Imported artwork is rescaled onto this library's 256-unit grid; the geometry is
otherwise unmodified. Lucide, Feather, Tabler, Heroicons and Iconoir are stroked
drawings, stored as centerline path data from which every weight is derived.
Material Symbols and Ionicons are filled artwork with no lighter or heavier
variant, so each ships one weight and every other weight renders that one. The
90 `logo-*` icons are the Ionicons brand logos. LICENSES/ holds the full text of
all eight, one file per set, including the Apache 2.0 text required for Material
Symbols. Each is a verbatim copy of the LICENSE file in the upstream repository
linked above.

The Ionicons artwork is extracted from the Ionicons TrueType font as shipped in
@expo/vector-icons, which does not vendor Ionicons' own licence file.
LICENSES/ionicons.txt is taken from the Ionicons repository itself rather than
from that package.

Brand logos reproduce third-party trademarks. Their owners' trademark rights are
not licensed by Ionicons' MIT terms or by this licence, and use must not imply
endorsement by or affiliation with the trademark owner.

